  ── pi is set up ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── done ──

    ✓ Claude Code       installed, logged in
    ! Codex             installed, not logged in
      → simstim agents login codex pi
    ✕ opencode          not installed
      → simstim agents install opencode pi
    ✕ Antigravity CLI   not installed
      → simstim agents install antigravity pi

    Start your first session:
      simstim new pi --agent claude

    enter start a session   esc close
